      "rationale": "Add a fixed 5% residual memory path to every GRU layer: h_t = 0.95 * GRUCell(x_t, h_prev) + 0.05 * h_prev. Batched input projections reduce loop overhead. Preserve GRU parameters, padding processing, embeddings, readout, scoring, loss, optimizer and dataset routing. The generated predictor already imports GRU4RecModel from train.py, so it automatically uses the identical recurrence and checkpoint layout.",
